# <%= projectName %>

| | |
| --- | --- |
| Import path | `<%= importPath %>` |
| Tags | `scope:<%= scope %>`, `type:feature` |
| Route | `/<%= routePath %>` (render mode: `<%= renderMode %>`) |
| Spec | [`<%= spec %>`](../../../<%= spec %>) |

## Contract

- May depend on: `type:ui`, `type:data`, `type:util`, `type:tokens` within `scope:<%= scope %>` or `scope:shared`.
- May NOT be imported by any other project (features are leaves; the shell mounts them by route).
- Every test cites a requirement id from the spec. Every requirement in the spec has at least one test.
- Acceptance scenarios live in `apps/shell-e2e/src/<%= fileName %>.spec.ts` and are written from the spec's Given/When/Then before implementation.
